{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A horror game / walking simulator set across seven distinct maps, each with small puzzles and challenges. The maps can be accessed in any order chosen by the player, with the final goal of opening a mysterious door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.poster.avif?t=1753718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.webm?t=1753718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.mp4?t=1753718129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you take on the role of the character Yindy, not knowing much about her \u2014 other than the certainty that she\u2019s just as confused as you are. Some intriguing characters may offer answers\u2026 but what can really be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/7406befab3970f68f68a2b859f0735da.poster.avif?t=1753718129\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/7406befab3970f68f68a2b859f0735da.webm?t=1753718129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/7406befab3970f68f68a2b859f0735da.mp4?t=1753718129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 We at LOBO SETA GAMES do not use any pre-made assets, plugins, or content.<br>\u2022 The translation was done automatically and may contain errors.<br>\u2022